msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "gateau st. honore"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/baked.json
msgid ""
"A gâteau St. Honoré is a French cake that incorporates layers of classic puff"
" pastry, balls of choux pastry, and pastry cream.  This cake originated in "
"nineteenth-century France and was named after Saint Honoré, the French patron"
" saint of bakers and pastry chefs."
msgstr ""

